{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only multiprofile model using the scvi_n200 RNA encoder, replacing the pca_n2000 encoder from config_002, while retaining avgpool aggregation and no image fusion. The validation accuracy of 0.6501 (F1: 0.6275) suggests the scvi_n200 encoder may improve performance compared to pca_n2000, though other factors like aggregation or profile settings could also influence results. Uncertainty remains about the optimal RNA representation and whether further encoder variations could yield additional gains."
}

